+// shutdownGrace is how long to wait for the pumps before redialling. After a
+// path change there is nothing to wait for: the flow is dead, and the device
+// reader is serialized by readMu exactly as it is across a rotation. Waiting
+// was the whole redial (measured 2026-10-08: the dial is ~60ms, the grace 2s).
+func shutdownGrace(err error) time.Duration {
+	if errors.Is(err, errHopChanged) {
+		return 0
+	}
+	return pumpShutdownGrace
